<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλίαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιάζομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be turned aside, unabating</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχη, ὅμαδος, γόος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.471
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.760
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμον δ᾽ ἀ. ἔγειρε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀνίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					611
				</span></i>
			: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ ἀλίαστον ὀδύρεο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.549
				</span></i>
			, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρὴν ἀλίαστος φρίσσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύς, κῦμα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1326
			</span></i>, acc. to Sch., cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				63.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>undaunted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1479
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			 word, used twice by <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> in lyr.</div>
